EXPERIMENT 5: FLIGHT RESERVATION SYSTEM
1. AIM
To design and develop an Online Flight Reservation System using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript to search for flights, enter passenger details, select travel class, calculate ticket fares, and confirm flight reservations.
2. ALGORITHM
1. Start the program.
2. Create a webpage for the online flight reservation system.
3. Design the webpage using HTML and CSS.
4. Display available flights with flight numbers, airlines, departure times, and ticket prices.
5. Allow users to enter source, destination, and travel date.
6. Display flights matching the selected route.
7. Allow users to select a flight and enter passenger details.
8. Provide options to select travel class and number of passengers.
9. Validate the entered details and calculate the total ticket fare.
10. Generate a booking reference and display the reservation confirmation.
3. HTML CODE
